flowchart LR
    Human[Human operator] -->|one-time pairing code| Pair[Device pairing screen]
    Pair -->|device-bound key, never leaves the machine| Sidecar[Installed local MCP sidecar]
    Agent[Claude Code / Codex] -->|stdio| Sidecar
    Sidecar -->|signed request over TLS| API[Control-plane API]
    API --> Intersection[Device grant AND server allowlist AND scope AND live RBAC]
    Intersection --> Operations[Audited server operations]
    Operations -->|internal node bearer token| Worker[Host worker agent]
    Operations --> Audit[(Owner + device attribution)]
    Sidecar -. requires install, update, and support on every operator machine .-> Human
    Sidecar -. second holder of delegated authority on an unattested endpoint .-> API
